## Timezone Issues

**⚠️ UTC ONLY** - No timezone configuration

```typescript
// ❌ Wrong: "0 9 * * *" // 9am UTC, not local
// ✅ Right: "0 17 * * *" // 9am PST (UTC-8) = 17:00 UTC
