## Event Dispatching

**Fetch (no HTTP server):**
```js
const res = await mf.dispatchFetch("http://localhost:8787/path", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: { "Authorization": "Bearer token" },
  body: JSON.stringify({ data: "value" }),
});
