## Core SDK Patterns

### Basic Setup
```typescript
import RealtimeKitClient from '@cloudflare/realtimekit';

const meeting = new RealtimeKitClient({ authToken, video: true, audio: true });
meeting.self.on('roomJoined', () => console.log('Joined:', meeting.meta.meetingTitle));
