2. **Configure tunnel:**

```yaml
# config.yml
tunnel: <TUNNEL_ID>
credentials-file: /path/to/credentials.json

ingress:
  - hostname: db.internal.example.com
    service: tcp://10.0.1.50:5432
  - hostname: api.internal.example.com
    service: http://10.0.1.100:8080
  - service: http_status:404
```

