## Instance Management

```typescript
// Create single
const instance = await env.MY_WORKFLOW.create({id: crypto.randomUUID(), params: { userId: 'user123' }}); // id optional, auto-generated if omitted

// Batch (max 100, idempotent: skips existing IDs)
