  directives: {
    scriptSrc: ["'self'", "'unsafe-inline'"], // ❌ Defeats purpose of CSP!
    // Allows inline scripts: <script>maliciousCode()</script>
  },
}));
```

**Risk:** Critical - XSS attacks bypass CSP, full script execution allowed

