### ✅ ALWAYS: Prevent Clickjacking

```typescript
import helmet from 'helmet';

// ✅ Deny all framing (most secure)
app.use(
  helmet.frameguard({
    action: 'deny', // Cannot be embedded in any iframe
  })
);

// ✅ Allow same-origin framing only
